   "value": "<p><strong>Invented Tech Upgrade:</strong> Upgrade DV21; total material cost: the item's cost + 500eb</p>\n<p>Invented Tech Upgrade for a Non-Concealable, Non-Explosive Two-Handed Ranged Weapon other than a bow: it becomes concealable, but attacks take -2 (-4 beyond 50m/yds) and every BODY requirement rises by 3. It overrides mods that prevent concealment (such as Conversion Kits or Upsized Power), but not attachments that do (such as an Extended Magazine or Foregrip).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>Price is 0 because a Tech builds this; the material cost depends on the item upgraded.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Invented Weapon Upgrades).</em></p>"
